---
import Title from '../Title.astro';
import Stats from './Stats.astro';
import Carousel from '../Carousel';
---

<div id="profile">
  <Title styles="mb-6">Profile</Title>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
      <!-- placeholder image -->
      <Carousel client:visible />
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-8 sm:gap-10 lg:col-span-2">
        <p class="text-primary-950/70 dark:text-primary-200/70 sm:text-lg lg:text-justify">
          Born in Argentina in 1989, I am a certified translator with 15 years of experience and top quality ratings. Drawing from a broad international background, I collaborate with Japanese and global organizations on
          a variety of projects, facilitating interactions and growth in diverse markets. <br /><br
          />I specialize in business and media, but I am also active in other fields including tourism, marketing, education, and international cooperation (ODA). Through consistent terminology management and quality testing, my work goes beyond meeting clients’ to deliver impactful results. Let's get started!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Stats />
  </div>
</div>
